if TO_BENEFICIARY
  if BENEFICIARY_NAME
    p Hi #{BENEFICIARY_NAME},
  else
    p Hi,
  if REASON_OWNER_ACTIVITY
    p The transfer of the account #{USERNAME} to you is cancelled: the account is in use again.
  else if REASON_DELEGATE_ACTIVITY
    p The transfer of the account #{USERNAME} to you is cancelled: the account is in use again.
  else if REASON_OWNER_CHANGE
    p The transfer of the account #{USERNAME} to you is cancelled: its holder changed their choice.
  else
    p The transfer of the account #{USERNAME} to you is cancelled.
  p You have nothing to do. Any link you received for this transfer no longer works.
else
  p Hi #{USERNAME},
  if REASON_DECLINED
    p #{BENEFICIARY} declined the transfer of your account.
    if FALLBACK_DELETE
      p Your account will now be deleted, as you chose for that case: on the planned date, or right away if that date has passed. All the data of the account will then be erased, and this cannot be undone.
    else
      p Your account stays as it is.
  else if REASON_OWNER_ACTIVITY
    p Your account was used, so its transfer to #{BENEFICIARY} was cancelled. The schedule starts again from now.
  else if REASON_DELEGATE_ACTIVITY
    p Your account was used by someone who manages it, so its transfer to #{BENEFICIARY} was cancelled. The schedule starts again from now.
  else
    p The transfer of your account to #{BENEFICIARY} is cancelled. Your account stays as it is.
  if ACCOUNT_APP_URL
    p
      | To change this, sign in to your account page and change the auto-deletion setting:
      |
      a(href=ACCOUNT_APP_URL target="_blank" rel="noopener") #{ACCOUNT_APP_URL}
  else
    p To change this, sign in to your account page and change the auto-deletion setting.
